<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT Placer Dome.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT Placer Dome.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed that it cut its rating on Placer Dome Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/2 at 23-5/8 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
